# .zshrc.local — local overrides that ~/.zshrc sources last.
#
# Setup copies this template to ~/.zshrc.local on the first run and never
# overwrites an existing file. The real file is gitignored: values stay on
# this machine, out of the repo and its history. Keep user-specific,
# non-secret config here only — resolve secrets per invocation with
# op/sopsx (see ~/.zfunctions).

# obsidian.nvim default vault. Explicit by design — no auto-detect: with
# multiple vaults, "first found" is arbitrary, not your intent. Three states:
#   set to a valid path  -> enabled
#   unset/commented out  -> nvim warns once per session
#   "off"                -> explicitly disabled, silent
# export OBSIDIAN_VAULT="$HOME/path/to/your/vault"
